@startuml SEQ_Tabungan
' ============================================================
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - Tabungan Siswa (Simplified)
' (Setor, Tarik, Lihat Riwayat)
' Sistem Informasi Keuangan Sekolah Ananda
' ============================================================
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #00838F
  ActorBorderColor #006064
  ActorBackgroundColor #E0F7FA
  LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
}
skinparam roundcorner 8

title Sequence Diagram — Tabungan Siswa (Disederhanakan)\nSistem Informasi Keuangan Sekolah Ananda

actor "Bendahara" as Bendahara
actor "Orang Tua/Wali" as Ortu
participant "Sistem" as Sys
database "Database" as DB

== Alur: Tampilkan Tabungan & Riwayat ==
Bendahara -> Sys : Buka Menu Tabungan Siswa
activate Sys
Sys -> DB : Ambil Data Siswa & Saldo
activate DB
DB --> Sys : Data Siswa & Saldo
deactivate DB
Sys --> Bendahara : Tampilkan Daftar Tabungan Siswa
deactivate Sys

Bendahara -> Sys : Lihat Detail Riwayat Mutasi Siswa
activate Sys
Sys -> DB : Ambil Riwayat Mutasi
activate DB
DB --> Sys : Data Mutasi
deactivate DB
Sys --> Bendahara : Tampilkan Riwayat Transaksi
deactivate Sys

== Alur: Setor / Tarik Tabungan ==
Bendahara -> Sys : Input Form Mutasi (Setor/Tarik) & Simpan
activate Sys
Sys -> Sys : Validasi Input & Cek Saldo (Jika Tarik)

alt Saldo Tidak Cukup (Penarikan)
  Sys --> Bendahara : Tampilkan Error Saldo
else Validasi Berhasil
  Sys -> DB : Simpan Mutasi & Update Saldo Tabungan
  activate DB
  DB --> Sys : Sukses
  deactivate DB
  Sys --> Bendahara : Tampilkan Notifikasi Sukses & Saldo Baru
end
deactivate Sys

== Alur: Orang Tua Lihat Tabungan ==
Ortu -> Sys : Buka Menu Tabungan Anak
activate Sys
Sys -> DB : Ambil Data Tabungan (Relasi Ortu-Anak)
activate DB
DB --> Sys : Saldo & Riwayat Anak
deactivate DB
Sys --> Ortu : Tampilkan Saldo & Riwayat Mutasi
deactivate Sys

@enduml
